FreeCAD is free software developed by an enthusiastic community of users, some of whom develop code, and many others who contribute in one form or another to make the software better by writing documentation, finding and reporting bugs, submitting ideas, writing tutorials, and many other things. The more and more active we are, the faster the software gets developed further. Why not join us? A good place to start is the [https://forum.freecad.org/viewforum.php?f=23 BIM section on the FreeCAD forum]. See you there!
